OL,3,ARussell Brand found guilty of rape and
OL,4,Asexual assault
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 51-year-old was refused bail and
OL,7,Fwill spend the weekend in custody
OL,8,Fbefore he is due to return to the same
OL,9,Fcourt on Monday for sentencing.
